WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[Opening Theme] “Across the starlit horizon, our oath remains unbroken!”

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
“Sector 4 barrier is holding—all vanguard units, advance on my signal!”

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
“Wait… that energy reading—it’s coming from inside the ancient shrine!”

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
“Release the Kitsune seal! We end this battle right here, right now!”
